OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with patchy rain and hill fog,
OL,7,Fespecially in the south and west.
OL,8,FCornwall and areas near to the south
OL,9,Fcoast will have cloud at times through
OL,10,Fthe day. Elsewhere warm sunshine
OL,11,Fbreaking through. Feeling humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome early evening sunshine
OL,14,Fin the east, though rather cloudy
OL,15,Felsewhere. Cloud thickening from the
OL,16,Fnorthwest overnight bringing some hill
OL,17,Ffog and patchy light rain. Staying
OL,18,Fwarm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
