OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy and damp
OL,6,Fmorning with some mostly light rain.
OL,7,FBrightening up from the northwest
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon to leave a fine
OL,9,Fevening. Breezy, and turning fresher
OL,10,Fthan recently.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday looks dry with some sunshine
OL,14,Fand gentle winds. Turning windy from
OL,15,Fthe northwest on Sunday with some rain
OL,16,Farriving later, ahead of brighter
OL,17,Fskies again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
